{
  "id": "2SA.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samweli 19",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagambira Yoabu bati, “Leba Omukama nalira, nachulira Abusalomu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abantu bachura, ebyera by'okusinga endashana bilekera, okuba bakahulira okwo Omukama Daudi okufa kw'omutabani kwamujunaize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo abantu bakagaruka omu kigo nibashooba nk'abagaruka bajunaire aha rw'okusingwa endashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama ayebunda aha maisho atongya n'eiraka lihango ati, “Yo, mwana wange Abusalomu, yo Abusalomu mwana wange, mwana wange!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu ataha omu nju, agoba Omukama amugambira ati, “Kir'eki washonaza abairu bawe bona abakurokora kir'eki batakwita, bakarokora na bakazi bawe, abana bawe n'ensholeke zawe; manya nabo bakubaisire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wagonza abakunoba, wanoba abakugonza. Wayolekera kimoi okwo abakuru b'eihe n'abaramata bawe batalikukugasha kantu. Nanye kir'eki namanya okwo ka Abusalomu yakuhungiire, kandi ichwe chwena tukafa, iwe wakushemeleirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu aha oshohore, ofumore n'abairu bawe obaihyemu entima mbi. Obuso bw'Omukama k'otashohoire kir'eki tolikusigara na muntu, kandi ekyo kirakurugiramu akabi kushaga buli kabi akarakugwireho kwema buto kugoba mbwenu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Daudi nikwo kwimuka akabandaara omu kihigi. Bagambira abantu bona okwo Omukama abandaire omu kihigi. Bona baija omu mabonage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli bona bakaba bairukire, buli muntu agarukire omwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enganda zona omuli Isiraeli bikaba bibashobeize, bati, “Omukama akatuhungya omu mikono y'ababisha baitu, Abafilisiti, mbwenu wenene airukire Abusalomu yaruga aha ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abusalomu owo twakozire amajuta k'atutwara agwire omu ndashana. Mbwenu kubaki inywe mutalikugamba kantu aha kugarura Omukama?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Daudi atuma ahali Zadoki na Abiatari abakuhani ati, “Mubaze abagurusi ba Yuda muti, ‘Omukama yamanyire okwo Abaisiraeli bona bagambire kumugarura omwe, mbwenu inywe n'inywe mwaija kuba b'enzindo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe muli barumuna bange, muli bwamba bwange, mubili gwange; kiki inywe kuba b'enzindo kungarura?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbalize Amasa muti, ‘Iwe toli bwamba bwange, mubili gwange? Ruhanga n'akanyite kantakuhindwire mukuru w'eihe lyange aha mwanya gwa Yoabu.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agweleza atyo abantu bona ba Yuda bagamba eiraka limoi, bamutumaho bati, “Ogaruke n'abaramata bawe bona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agaruka, agoba Yorudani. Aba Yuda baija Giligali kumuchwekera n'okumushabura Yorudani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimei eya Gera, Omubenjamini wa Bahurimu, ayanguha asongoka n'abashaija ba Yuda kuchwekera Omukama Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagenda n'abashaija 1,000 ab'oruganda rwa Benjamini. Ziba omusigire w'omwa Shauli, nawe agenda n'abatabani 15 n'abairube 20, basongoka Yorudani bebembeire Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashabuka ekyambu kushabura eka y'Omukama, n'okumukolera eby'alikwenda. Orw'Omukama yabaire yaija kushabuka Yorudani, Shimei amugwa omu maisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amugambira ati, “Mukama wange, singa otankwata ntambara, otaijuka na kyo nakukozire, nkakushenga kiro ekyo waruga Yerusalemu; oyebwe, osingire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomanya okwo nafakaire, kyonkai olebe okwo omu ruganda rwona rwa Yozefu n'inye naija ndi wa mbere kukuchwekera!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Abishai eya Zeruya ahorora ati, “Shimei bamwite azire ekyo yakozire, kuba akakeena enkorwa majuta y'Omukama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Daudi agamba ati, “Mbagiire ntai inywe batabani ba Seruya, nka mwambera Sitani? Mbwenu aha Omukama wa Isiraeli n'inye; kir'eki taliho Mwisiraeli alikwija kwitwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho arahilira Shimei ati, “Tofe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mefibosheti eya Shauli nawe asongoka kuchwekera Omukama. Kwema orwo Omukama yarugire Yerusalemu kulemwa kugaruka eli milembe, Mefibosheti hakaba atakanabaga maguru, atakasharaga bileju anga kufura myendoye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo yarugire Yerusalemu kuchwekera Omukama, Omukama amugambira ati, “Mefibosheti, kubaki otagenzire nanye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuhorora ati, “Rugaba Mukama wange, omwiru wange akambeiya. Nkamugambira nti, ‘Nyalira endogobe ngikuube ngende n'Omukama,’ kuba mba mulema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenene ogwo akampangilira ahali iwe, kyonkai kandi Rugaba Mukama wange oshusha omumalaika wa Ruhanga; aha rw'ekyo singa okore okw'orayenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'omwaitu wakubaisire bona, kyonkai okandonkamu kuta nindya aha kiihuro kyawe. Mbwenu nkutongeki ekishagireho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama amugambira ati, “N'orwo wakuba otagambire bindi; naramwire. Iwe na Ziba murabegana ensi ya Shauli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mefibosheti agambira Omukama ati, “Ziba agitware yona, orwo wagaruka omwawe n'emilembe, Rugaba Mukama wange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Barizilai Omugileadi hakaba arugire Rogelimu yashendekeleza Omukama yamugobya Yorudani, yasiga yashabuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba ali mugurusi muno ow'emyaka 80. Yahaga Omukama Daudi ekyakulya orwo yaikaraga Mahanaimu, okuba hakaba ali mushaija mushongore muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama amugambira ati, “Tushabuke hamoi tugye Yerusalemu, ndakugabira, nkumanye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Barizilai amuhorora ati, “Nkyaina emyaka engahai y'okurora, inye kugenda naiwe Yerusalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye aha nyina emyaka 80, tinkiina kya kunshemelera. Na kulya na kunywa tinkishemelerwa kantu. Na bashaija na bakazi tibakizina bikantaha. Mbwenu aho Rugaba Mukama wange, nakushasizaki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yorudani turagishabuka hamoi; kyonkai kubaki ondongore erongoro etyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkushaba onjubure ngaruke, nfere omu kigo kyange, banziike omu nziiko ya tata na mawe. Omwiru wawe Kimuhamu murashabuka hamoi, okw'orayenda obe nikwo omukora.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agamba ati, “Kimuhamu turashabuka hamoi, ekiranshemelera kyona kyona ndakimukolera; kandi naiwe eky'orayenda ndakikukolera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abantu bona bashabuka Yorudani, n'Omukama ashabuka; anywegera Barizilai, mara amuha omugisha, Barizilai agaruka omuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama ashabuka na Kimuhamu, bagya Giligali, aba Yuda bona enusu y'abantu ba Isiraeli bamushendekeleza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Abaisiraeli bona baija aha Mukama, bamubaza bati, “Kubaki barumuna baitu aba Yuda bakwibire, bakakushabura Yorudani n'eka yawe n'abashaija bawe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Yuda bahorora aba Isiraeli bati, “Okuba Omukama w'oruganda rwaitu. Aho kubaki ekyo nikibanigaza? Haliho eky'Omukama kyona kyona ekyo tuliire, anga aina eky'atuhaire?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli bahorora aba Yuda bati, “Omukama Daudi waitu emirundi ikumi nangu n'okushaga. Aho kubaki mutugahire? T'ichwe tutabaire tuli ba mbere kugamba kugarura Omukama waitu?” Kyonkai aba Yuda bakakiza Abaisiraeli amani aha rulimi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
